 "IMG_9014.wav": {
  "lang": "en",
  "segs": [
   {
    "s": 0.0,
    "e": 6.72,
    "t": "So initially the customers, they had the idea only remodel the shower area, but I mean"
   },
   {
    "s": 6.72,
    "e": 11.28,
    "t": "this space needs a lot of work. So I gave them some suggestion and we ended up doing"
   },
   {
    "s": 11.28,
    "e": 17.84,
    "t": "the whole thing. So first there was a big wall here partition to the privacy here."
   },
   {
    "s": 17.84,
    "e": 22.32,
    "t": "So it was really narrow to get into the shower. We demoed the whole thing out to"
   },
   {
    "s": 22.32,
    "e": 29.64,
    "t": "make a really open space with a new custom vanity countertop to match the tile that"
   },
   {
    "s": 29.64,
    "e": 35.44,
    "t": "the customer choose. All the fixtures are completely new. Drywall repair, painting,"
   },
   {
    "s": 35.78,
    "e": 42.14,
    "t": "and of course the shower is the masterpiece. It's a classic subway tile,"
   },
   {
    "s": 42.32,
    "e": 47.2,
    "t": "but we did it again, make it look great like a luxury bathroom with a custom"
   },
   {
    "s": 47.2,
    "e": 52.2,
    "t": "niche, shower floor, and of course a nice glass custom door."
   }
